<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Maxtel says in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Maxtel says in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxtel Ltd said on Wednesday it was involved in talks which if successful could have an effect on its share price. Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
